atter how many times he attempts to knock some sense into her, the girl bounces right back to her usual shenanigans, even dragging in some other eccentrics along for the ride. Try as he might to rein in her nonsense, every moment is unpredictable with Yoshiko and her profound idiocy on the loose.\n\n\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"],"ja":["アホガール",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-50632":"2023-04-23T18:02:28Z","serial-23618":"2020-03-13T11:52:08Z","serial-4197":"2019-11-26T12:05:52Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-50632","serial-23618","serial-4197"],"relatedMalIds":[],"availableEpisodeCount":12,"rating":6.71}]}